<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>To Him shall endless prayer be made.</l><l>And princes throng to crown His head,</l><l>His name like sweet perfume shall rise</l><l>With every morning sacrifice.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>People and realms of every tongue</l><l>Dwell on His love with sweetest song;</l><l>And infant voices shall proclaim</l><l>Their early blessings on His name.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Blessings abound where’er He reigns:</l><l>The prisoner leaps to lose his chains,</l><l>The weary find eternal rest,</l><l>And all the sons of want are blest.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Where He displays His healing power</l><l>Death and the curse are known no more;</l><l>In Him the tribes of Adam boast</l><l>More blessings than their father lost.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Let every creature rise and bring</l><l>Peculiar honors to our King;</l><l>Angels descend with songs again,</l><l>And earth repeat the loud Amen.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
